<div class="modal fade" id="deleteInvoiceModal" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
    <div class="modal-content border-0" style="border-radius:24px;">
      <div class="modal-body text-center p-4">
        <div class="mx-auto mb-3 d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center"
             style="width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:22px;background:#fee2e2;color:#dc2626;font-size:1.6rem;">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i>
        </div>

        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-2" style="font-size:1.25rem;">Supprimer cette facture ?</h2>

        <p class="text-muted mb-4" style="font-size:.9rem;">
          Cette action est définitive. Le document et ses données seront supprimés.
        </p>

        <div class="d-grid gap-2">
          <%= button_to "Oui, supprimer",
                invoice_path(invoice),
                method: :delete,
                class: "btn btn-danger btn-lg w-100",
                data: { turbo: false } %>

          <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-lg w-100" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
            Annuler
          </button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
